<p>Use this menu to specify whether or not to print a watermark on a document.</p>
<p>Available functions differ depending on the printer or printer driver you are using.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="default" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Restore Defaults</span></p>
<p>Restores the settings on this menu to the default settings.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="unauthorized" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Unauthorized Copy Prevention</span></p>
<p>Select the check box to set unauthorized copy prevention.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Unauthorized Copy Prevention Type</span></p>
<p>Select the prevention effect that you want from the list.</p>
<p aria-level="4" class="T3" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Unauthorized Copy Prevention for Pattern</span></p>
<p class="Normal-indent">Use this function to embed a text and background 
 pattern in confidential documents. If an unauthorized copy of the document 
 is made, the background pattern and text will be clearly visible. This 
 function makes it easy to identify unauthorized copies.</p>
<p class="Normal-indent"><a href="~/Topics/IDH_HOW_PREVENT">Using Unauthorized 
 Copy Prevention Function (Effects of Prevention for Pattern)</a></p>
<p aria-level="4" class="T3" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Data Security for Copying</span></p>
<p class="Normal-indent">If a document with an embedded copy guard pattern 
 is copied, scanned, and/or stored in a machine with the Copy Data Security 
 unit, the image of the page to be printed is destroyed, and turn the copy's 
 color completely gray.</p>
<p class="Normal-indent"><a href="~/Topics/IDH_HOW_GUARD">Using Data Security 
 for Copying Function (Destroy the Image and Print gray)</a></p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="unauthorizededit" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Details...</span></p>
<p>Opens the dialog box to specify the details of the unauthorized copy 
 prevention.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="number" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Background Numbering</span></p>
<p>Select the checkbox to add background numbers when printing.</p>
<p><a href="~/Topics/IDH_HOW_BACKGROUNDNUMBERING">Printing Control Numbers on 
 the Background of Documents</a></p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="numberedit" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Details...</span></p>
<p>Opens the dialog box to specify the details of the background numbering.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="headerfooter" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Header/Footer</span></p>
<p>Select the items that you want to print on header and footer.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="headerfooteredit" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Details...</span></p>
<p>Opens the <span class="Term-Soft">Edit Header/Footer</span> dialog box, 
 where you can edit and create header and footer.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="watermark" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Print Watermark</span></p>
<p>Select the check box to print a watermark.</p>
<p><a href="~/Topics/IDH_HOW_WATERMARK">Having Text Stamped on Prints</a></p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Watermarks:</span></p>
<p>Select the watermark that you want to print from the list.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="watermarkedit" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Edit...</span></p>
<p>Opens the <span class="Term-Soft">Edit Watermark</span> dialog box, where 
 you can edit and create watermarks.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="overlay" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Add Overlay</span></p>
<p>Select the check box to print a document with previously created Overlay 
 Data superimposed.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Overlay Data:</span></p>
<p>Select the Overlay Setting that you want to use.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="overlayedit" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Edit...</span></p>
<p>Opens the <span class="Term-Soft">Edit Overlay</span> dialog box where 
 you can edit and create Overlay Setting.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="bitmap" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Add Bitmap</span></p>
<p>Select the check box to print a bitmap file (extension .bmp) as bitmap 
 watermark.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Bitmap:</span></p>
<p>Select the bitmap watermark that you want to print from the list.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="bitmapedit" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Edit...</span></p>
<p>Opens the <span class="Term-Soft">Edit Bitmap</span> dialog box where 
 you can edit and create bitmap watermarks.</p>
